Package: sportmetrics
Type: Package
Title: Test Whether Advanced Sports Metrics Add Value Over Traditional Stats
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Rashaad", "Jones", email = "rashaadjones@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Three reusable diagnostic functions for testing whether an
    advanced sports metric adds real value over a traditional statistic:
    incremental predictive validity (redundancy), split-half reliability
    (noise), and distributional discriminability (variance). Designed to
    be run identically across baseball, football, and basketball data.
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
